{"strongs": "H8052", "word": "שְׁמוּעָה", "translit": "she.mu.ah", "root": "שמן", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "report", "definition": "שְׁמוּעָה noun feminine report ; — absolute ׳ שׁ 1Sam 4:19 +, שְׁמֻעָה 1Sam 2:24 +; construct שְׁמֻעַת 2Sam 4:4 suffix שְׁמֻעָתֵ֫נוּ Isa 53:1 plural absolute שְׁמֻעוֺת Dan 11:44 — 1. report , sometimes after שָׁמַע 1Sam 2:24 ; 1Sam 4:19 (= news ), 1Kgs 10:7 = 2Chr 9:6 ; 2Kgs 19:7 = Isa 37:7 ; Jer 51:46 רָעָה ׳ שׁ Jer 49:23 , compare Ps 112:7 , and טוֺבָח ׳ שׁ Prov 15:30 ; Prov 25:25 tidings about Saul 2Sam 4:4 with בָּאָה 2Sam 13:30 (+ לֵאמֹר ), 1Kgs 2:28 ; Ezek 21:12 ; Jer 10:22 , compare Jer 51:46 + ( בָּאָה omitted) v Jer 51:46 ׳ אֶלשֿׁ ׳ תָּבוֺא שׁ Ezek 7:28 יְבַהֲלֻהוּ ׳ שׁ Dan 11:44 שְׁמוּעָתֵנוּ Isa 53:1 the report that reached us compare also Isa 28:9 ; Isa 28:19 ; Jer 49:14 ; Obad 1:1 ( De Du and others specifically of prophetic message but see Gie Beiträge 155 f. We Now Obad 1:1 ). 2. = mention בְּפִיךְ ׳ לאֹ הָֽיְתָח סְדֹם לִשׁ Ezek 16:56 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8831')\">BDB8831</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8052')\">H8052</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8830')\">BDB8830</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8832')\">BDB8832</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁמוּעָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>report</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,19)\">1Sam 4:19</ref> +, <bdbheb>שְׁמֻעָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,24)\">1Sam 2:24</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>שְׁמֻעַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,4)\">2Sam 4:4</ref> suffix <bdbheb>שְׁמֻעָתֵ֫נוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 53:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick